  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EBRD BAS Women in Business Fund Moldova - EBRD Women in Business</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">EBRD BAS Women in Business Fund Moldova</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Under EBRD BAS Programme in Moldova -a WIB /Women in Business Fund for Moldova with a special focus on support to women entrepreneurs was launched in May 2012. The Objective is to promote women&#x2019;s entrepreneurship in Moldova as an instrument to support transition to market economy. About 90 -120 SMEs owned or managed or with majority of female labour force will be supported in 4 years.</narrative>
